    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="17">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Cn1027">Cn 1027</ref> 17</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Haec et his similia si, dum venero, non erunt persoluta, regia exactio secundum leges in quem culpa cadit, districte absque venia comparabit. Valete.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, when I come, these and other similar dues have not been paid, they shall be exacted by the royal officials in accordance with the laws, sternly and without remission, from him who is found to be in fault. [Farewell.]</ab>
      </div>
